flowchart LR
  V[Voter] --> K[4x4 keypad]
  O[Presiding officer] --> I[Open / close / tamper inputs]
  K --> C[Arduino Mega 2560\nfinite-state controller]
  I --> C
  B[Biometric match toggle] --> C
  C --> L[20x4 LCD\nstatus and final results]
  C --> A[Candidate buttons A-D]
  C --> E[LEDs and buzzer]
  C --> T[Serial1 audit terminal]
  C <--> M[Internal EEPROM\ncounts and voter flags + CRC]